      "chapterUid": 53,
      "range": "3173-3234",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "世界如此之大，做一个什么样的自己完全取决于你的选择。你可以选择破罐子破摔，待在原地，也可以选择一个不抱怨的世界，成就自己。",
      "totalCount": 15192
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 211147349,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_52_2225-2277",
      "chapterUid": 52,
      "range": "2225-2277",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "有多少人把性格交给星座，把努力交给鸡汤，把考试交给锦鲤，然后对自己说“听过许多道理，依然过不好这一生”。",
      "totalCount": 14130
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 17005014,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_60_826-851",
      "chapterUid": 60,
      "range": "826-851",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "舒适感，是成长最大的敌人；痛苦，是成长最好的标志。",
      "totalCount": 13680
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 314268241,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_50_1178-1213",
      "chapterUid": 50,
      "range": "1178-1213",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "愿我所见之人，所历之事，哪怕因为我有一点点的好的改变，我就心满意足了。",
      "totalCount": 10908
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 585102672,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_64_2446-2469",
      "chapterUid": 64,
      "range": "2446-2469",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "最好的投资是投资自己，最聪明的投资是投资未来。",
      "totalCount": 9786
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 219054594,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_50_2011-2066",
      "chapterUid": 50,
      "range": "2011-2066",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一个人，即使没有任何背景，靠着日复一日的坚持和努力，学会聚焦，在一个领域做到极致，也能闯出属于自己的一片天地。",
      "totalCount": 7360
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 49029232,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_63_2665-2707",
      "chapterUid": 63,
      "range": "2665-2707",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人应该适时闭嘴，在合适的时候说合适的话；始终应该保持低调，再有成绩也不该急着去展示。",
      "totalCount": 7344
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 397613090,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_71_3146-3191",
      "chapterUid": 71,
      "range": "3146-3191",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "任何看似无意义、目的性没那么强的事在将来看都是有意义的，只要你曾沉醉其中，全心全意去做过。",
      "totalCount": 7264
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 249811487,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_54_2461-2540",
      "chapterUid": 54,
      "range": "2461-2540",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "势能就是一个人的潜能，如果你一辈子什么都不尝试，最终只会默默无闻、悄无声息，但如果你把自己逼到看似绝境的境地，将势能全部转化为动能，生命就会呈现出夺目的光芒。",
      "totalCount": 6902
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 89904372,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_60_1749-1806",
      "chapterUid": 60,
      "range": "1749-1806",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“做小决定的时候听从大脑，可以分析利弊。而当做大决定时一定要追随自己的内心，因为你的心多多少少会知道要怎样选择。”",
      "totalCount": 6688
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 420608942,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_52_2486-2522",
      "chapterUid": 52,
      "range": "2486-2522",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“懂一百个道理，不如懂一个方法重要；一百次的感动，不如一次行动有帮助。”",
      "totalCount": 6624
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 585102672,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_77_3010-3059",
      "chapterUid": 77,
      "range": "3010-3059",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一个人最大的痛苦来自未完成任务而产生的持续的焦虑，以及在最后一刻完成任务而觉得任务没做好的负罪感。",
      "totalCount": 6304
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 9012842,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_66_1472-1483",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "1472-1483",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "成功=方向×方法×努力",
      "totalCount": 6090
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 558812481,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_55_998-1019",
      "chapterUid": 55,
      "range": "998-1019",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我们永远不知道，明天和意外，哪一个会先到。",
      "totalCount": 5837
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 89904372,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_52_1924-1957",
      "chapterUid": 52,
      "range": "1924-1957",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "只靠读道理，就妄图懂人生，这就意味着，大多数人实现不了自己的幻想。",
      "totalCount": 5832
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 585102672,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_88_4448-4485",
      "chapterUid": 88,
      "range": "4448-4485",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "马云说，一个人要成功，关键是要有自我治愈能力，学会用你的左手温暖你的右手。",
      "totalCount": 5382
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 389760989,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_54_1617-1655",
      "chapterUid": 54,
      "range": "1617-1655",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "在这个世界上，多的是“我原本可以……但是……”，然后就没有“然后”了的故事。",
      "totalCount": 5060
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 51679519,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_53_1659-1702",
      "chapterUid": 53,
      "range": "1659-1702",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“我们每一个人都是由自己一再重复的行为所铸造的，因而优秀不是一种行为，而是一种习惯。”",
      "totalCount": 4932
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 408759258,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_52_3905-3947",
      "chapterUid": 52,
      "range": "3905-3947",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "世界上哪有什么成功独门秘籍，当你学会把最简单的事做到极致时，成功自然也就离你不远了。",
      "totalCount": 4764
    },
    {
      "bookId": "681628",
      "userVid": 393789349,
      "bookmarkId": "681628_65_2510-2529",
      "chapterUid": 65,
      "range": "2510-2529",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你不先对自己狠心，全世界就会对你狠心。",
      "totalCount": 4437
    }
